{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"wc -l docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md && rg -n '\"'^#{1,5} |D742|D743'\"' docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/{BLIND3-RESULT.md,SMALL-DESIGN.md}\"","aggregated_output":"     201 docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:1:# judging-v13s blind test, third run after D742: result (SMALL-DESIGN.md §5 [D742])\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:18:- **The D742 rule was followed by every P-family writer.** All six recorded the Q4 pace as an estimate naming its benchmark, then\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:24:## 1. Writers' first answers (`CHECKED.json`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:35:## 2. Readers and adjudicators (`TALLY.json`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:57:## 3. What the test shows\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:60:  12 with a request contradiction (run 2), to 12 of 12 with no refusal (run 3). D742's rule was followed by all six writers it applies\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND3-RESULT.md:76:## 4. The blinded re-read (D743, Alex: \"补上那条，重读一遍\"; `reread-packets/`, `reread-adjudication/`, `REREAD-TALLY.json`)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:1:# judging-v13 small format (v13s): code refuses only the five defects and broken structure (D737)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:19:## 1. What is dropped, and where it goes\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:32:## 2. The rules code enforces (revised after round 52, `codex-r52.md`; the revision is marked [52])\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:59:## 2-old. The rules as first written (superseded by the revision above)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:78:## 3. The wire schema, word for word (examples from no covered company, AGENTS §6)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:143:## 4. Build\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:162:## 5. The $0 blind test (registered; REPAIR-DESIGN.md §5 with rounds 51's fixes)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:279:**[D742] Registered before the third run (council rounds 56–56c).** The re-run stopped on one S4 refusal of a sound answer\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:306:**[D743] The blinded re-read of the third run (Alex: \"补上那条，重读一遍\"; council round 57), registered before any packet is built.**\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
