{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"wc -l poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-{packets,adjudication}/Q*.md; rg -n 'plus or minus 3%|literal|estimate|benchmark' poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/P-v8/schema.json | head -24; rg -n 'registered|stop|council' AGENTS.md | tail -25; ls -d poc/data/judging-v13s-blind*\"","aggregated_output":"    1282 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q01.md\n     301 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q02.md\n     437 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q03.md\n    1019 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q04.md\n    1291 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q05.md\n      98 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q06.md\n     492 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q07.md\n     449 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q08.md\n     393 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q09.md\n     995 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q10.md\n    1165 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q11.md\n      98 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q12.md\n    1280 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q13.md\n     286 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-packets/Q14.md\n     531 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-adjudication/Q07.md\n     433 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-adjudication/Q09.md\n    1035 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-adjudication/Q10.md\n     325 poc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22/reread-adjudication/Q14.md\n   11910 total\n45:       \"estimate\"\n47:      \"description\": \"source: a number written in a shown passage's quote; computed: one operation on other figures; estimate: your judgement, with its assumption in basis_text.\"\n58:      \"description\": \"reported: an actual; guidance: the company's outlook; consensus: analysts' average; third_party: one outside party; forecast: this family's own forecast, on a computed or estimate figure only.\"\n415:        \"description\": \"Source only: a complete number exactly as the quote writes it, never a piece of a longer number, range or 'plus or minus' expression, with its currency and scale or its percent sign, and nothing else: '$4.5 billion', 'US$300 million', '$2.1bn', '40%', '-3%', 'double', 'twice'. The value is the number as written (a minus only when the quote writes one). A written range in full ('$3–4 billion', 'between $3 billion and $4 billion', '$3 billion to $4 billion'), given as low and high; a change written 'from $3 billion to $5 billion' is two numbers, each copied alone. '$4.5 billion, plus or minus 3%' in full, given as low and high or its midpoint as value. Only US dollars.\"\n520:      \"description\": \"The members whose forecast this figure is: your own forecast (a computed or estimate figure with basis forecast, even when it agrees with consensus), exactly one for each member answered as a forecast, none for an unresolved one. Its what is the member's outcome key, in USD bn.\"\n530:      \"description\": \"The members for which this figure is the market's reference. It and every figure beneath it is a source or a computed figure, never an estimate or a forecast, and at least one of them is a quoted consensus, guidance or outside figure. A past period's reported share or multiple carried to another period (a quarter's mix applied to the year) makes it our comparison estimate, not the market's reference.\"\n554:   \"description\": \"The family's calculation. Use one forecast figure for each quantity and period, as a point or a range, wherever that quantity is needed (outside figures beneath it, or a point a final range rests on, are fine). Guidance may inform a growth pace: record the pace you forecast as an estimate, say why it applies, name the benchmark in rests_on, and use that estimate in the calculation. A rate computed from a shared quantity's guidance or outside figure is never itself an input of the calculation. To turn a total into a narrower quantity (data-center spending out of total capital expenditure), write the deduction or share as its own figure, or give a supported bound; never relabel a total as the narrower quantity. Figures name each other by id; no figure may depend on itself.\"\n41:- **While Alex is not active, the council decides (D439).** A choice or a next step that would go to Alex, including opening a new\n42:  version of a piece frozen for \"a new version only Alex opens\" (never of the frozen ruler), goes to the council instead:\n45:  itself, every round logged with what it taught (Alex, 2026-11-13: \"把这个goal 改成更多的要求council in the loop 来自行的根据数据和目标做决策。我接下来不会active,需要你有问题的时候就fire council 然后和claude 掰扯直到你们能达到共识为止再下去执行，并仔细的测量，自己看trace 然后把每一轮log 做学习总结，不要饭一样的错，词学迭代完成我们的PRD生产目标\"; 2026-11-15, going inactive again (D509): \"我要睡觉了，下来你自行按照我的准则操作，需要深度的审视每一轮run 用council\").\n47:  provider caps are untouched; paid spending stays within D439's ceiling. A disagreement the council cannot settle is recorded with\n81:Then converge or stop:\n85:- When one mechanism draws findings round after round, stop answering findings: propose one structural rule.\n156:  any other reason means the test was written blind: stop and read again. A test is never mended to fit the code; it changes only when\n170:Verify at the point the change touches, at the sharpest level that shows it works or fails, and stop there:\n228:  (walk the whole page, first paragraph to last) and the stopping point (\"a page with eight such statements yields eight evidence\n261:  standard no longer stops an arm: record the concern separately, continue scoring on the unchanged frozen gold, and disclose it with the results (D373).\n277:  findings remain; clarity is tested apart, by independent readers on cases fixed before the text changes. A failed registered acceptance\n278:  stops the line and goes to Alex with its census; the next arm is never designed alone.\n334:  neighbouring cases stops being tuned on that set (Alex, 2026-11-09: \"感觉现在一直在修一些mknor的原地打转，你是不是要思考下现在具体还差什么high priority big impact 的需要做？\";\n341:- **Own the loop, within what Alex agreed.** When the direction is agreed and no stop is in force (`CURRENT_STATE.md`), push your own\n342:  hypotheses through $0 checks and probes of a few cents on stored cases without asking. A registered test, an end-to-end run, or\n343:  anything that departs from the agreed plan starts on his word; a result that contradicts the hypothesis stops the line and goes to him\n344:  (D355: \"如果有什么不符合hypothesis 的地方你需要终止然后和我说我们重新评估\"). While he is not active (D439), \"his word\" is the council's\n345:  recorded consensus, and a stopped line goes to the council for re-assessment.\n349:  \"你这些改动有我你有好好的跑council 再下手\").\n350:  Every round's reasoning and decisions are reflected on in the council until there is a consensus; the decision is recorded, and\n352:  by readers (Alex, 2026-11-10: \"你应该跑council loop 来reflect 你每一轮的思路还有决策，需要你打成共识，记录决策，向前直行测试。不要drift,我们有PRD和量化目标，\n369:  model applies it: before a registered test, the changed request is sent on the cases that motivated it, a few cents.\n427:  scored against the gold). A full-pipeline run, a registered test, or a paid send beyond the probes of a few cents an agreed direction\n444:  `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8788/days`, and stop what you started before handing over. Changing Docker or VPN networking is Alex's call.\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind-2026-11-22\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind2-2026-11-22\npoc/data/judging-v13s-blind3-2026-11-22\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
